#
# An item may move to the new machine, in Sutra (ferry_rules.h FR3). Its
# kind: 1 a file, 2 a space, 3 a setting, 4 a regulated setting, 5 a key.
# Files, spaces and settings move; a regulated setting or a key moves only
# with the owner's approval (approved = 1). kind and approved fit one
# digit: a negative or larger one is refused.
record move-ok
  kind: 9
  approved: 9
procedure
  if kind < 1 or kind > 5
    answer 0 = 1
  end-if
  answer kind < 4 or approved = 1
